{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Ana only needs six seeds from the depths of the forest. That's all. Then she can go home.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/755f46b860390d0a2a67f7a97490fc59.poster.avif?t=1755830982\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/755f46b860390d0a2a67f7a97490fc59.webm?t=1755830982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/755f46b860390d0a2a67f7a97490fc59.mp4?t=1755830982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1755830982\" width=23 height=17 /></span>\u00a0Explore freely through the forest and the cabin, gathering unique ingredients and items. Prepare hot drinks and cook strange meals that will help you interact with curious characters, each with their own personality and secrets. Use a special item that reveals hidden objects and essential clues, creating an experience full of exploration and mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1755830982\" width=23 height=17 /></span>\u00a0Conversations, forgotten notes and old newspapers contain history, allowing you to gradually find out more about this unsettling place by playing detective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/876bad8ec9d358b0bcceee23ce422f54.avif?t=1755830982\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1755830982\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0Atmospheric Exploration:\u00a0</strong>Wander through a  place full of secrets that seems forgotten in time.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1755830982\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0Horror, But Make It... Cozy?:</strong> Cook questionable food, brew drinks, unlock doors, collect odd objects and enjoy satisfying  sounds &amp; nature ambient background noise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1755830982\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0Down The Rabbit Hole:\u00a0</strong>Some things are hidden for a reason. You're not meant to see it all\u2014yet.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1755830982\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0Strange Items &amp; Hidden Clues:\u00a0</strong>Perfect for players seeking slow-burn suspense and immersive storytelling over fast-paced action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1755830982\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0Unusual Characters:\u00a0</strong>Meet others\u2026 if they let you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/a3eb8667e91fc3ba1e28e96177825d00.webp?t=1755830982\" width=23 height=17 /></span><strong>\u00a0No jumpscares:\u00a0</strong>Suspenseful horror focused on atmosphere and unease, no loud surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/19a2d51c2b57cc70d1b1a37f5d8faf7d.avif?t=1755830982\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u00a0Wander the forest, collect strange plants, &amp; share coffee with mysterious beings in <i>Nightfall Caf\u00e9</i>.\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/extras/37fbba6d693193c091daf4316ba67f67.webp?t=1755830982\" width=22 height=22 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816920?t=1755830982","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/7d02175d77669f7c894f429c1f0bb41a8a838be5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755830982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/777d46c3f57247d1d4c0a5aed0aa8860e12da2a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755830982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816920/777d46c3f57247d1d4c0a5aed0aa8860e12da2a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755830982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"F